IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT `uob-ladys`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `UOB Lady's Savings Account Rewards Program Terms and Conditions`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. uob-ladys-savings-rewards-tnc: "UOB Lady's Savings Account
-- Rewards Program Terms and Conditions", "As at 1 February 2026" (United
-- Overseas Bank Limited), cl.1-3. A SECOND DOCUMENT that adds to the Lady's
-- Cards terms (uob-ladys.l4); it is encoded as its own module, and the all-in
-- earn of a Lady's card for a cardholder with the savings account is the sum
-- of the two answers.
--
-- WHAT THE TEXT SAYS.
--   cl.2.1-2.2 Open to Personal, Wealth and Privilege Banking accountholders who
--              (a) are an Accountholder and a Lady's Card principal cardholder,
--              (b) maintain a Monthly Average Balance (MAB) of at least S$10,000
--              in a calendar month, and (c) have selected a Preferred Rewards
--              Category.
--   cl.2.3     The Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 spent on the Preferred
--              Rewards Category(ies): MAB S$10,000-49,999 5X (2 miles per S$1);
--              S$50,000-99,999 10X (4 miles); S$100,000 and above 15X (6 miles).
--   cl.2.4     "awarded in addition to the Base UNI$ and Bonus UNI$."
--   cl.2.5     Below S$10,000 MAB: no Savings Bonus; Base and Bonus continue.
--   cl.2.7-9   The combined caps. Classic / Platinum / World Mastercard: Bonus
--              capped at 1,800 plus Savings Bonus capped at 1,000 / 2,000 /
--              3,000 (per band), "equivalent to S$1,000 spent". Solitaire
--              (excluding Metal): Bonus capped at 2,700 plus Savings Bonus
--              capped at 1,500 / 3,000 / 4,500, "equivalent to S$1,500 spent
--              (with each Preferred Rewards Category capped at 2,100 / 2,850 /
--              3,600 UNI$, which is equivalent to S$750 in spending per
--              Preferred Rewards Category)". Solitaire Metal: Bonus 3,600 plus
--              Savings Bonus 2,000 / 4,000 / 6,000, "equivalent to S$2,000".
--   cl.2.11    Credited by the end of the following calendar month.
--   cl.2.13    Foreign-currency spend counts at its Singapore-dollar amount.
-- THE SPEND THE UPLIFT RUNS ON IS THE SPEND THE BONUS RUNS ON. Every cap above
-- is stated "equivalent to S$X spent", and the Savings Bonus caps are exactly
-- X dollars at 1, 2 or 3 UNI$ per S$1 (5X, 10X, 15X per S$5): S$1,500 x 1 =
-- 1,500; x 2 = 3,000; x 3 = 4,500. So the uplift is paid on the dollars that
-- still earn the Bonus, and stops when the Bonus does. The module reads the
-- Bonus room from the Lady's Cards module and does not keep a second cap.
--
-- THE BAND IS A MONTH-END FACT. The MAB is "the summation of each day-end
-- balance ... divided by the number of calendar days", known only at month end.
-- The cardholder states her band; every answer carries the condition "the
-- Savings band holds for the whole calendar month".
--
-- THE FORK F-uob-per-five applies as in the Lady's Cards module: floor on
-- whole S$5 blocks, ceiling pro rata.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.2.3 -- the uplift by band`

-- UNI$ per S$5, by Monthly Average Balance band. 0 below S$10,000 (cl.2.5).
GIVEN band IS A `Savings band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` band MEANS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `Under S$10,000`        THEN 0
    WHEN `S$10,000 to S$49,999`  THEN 5
    WHEN `S$50,000 to S$99,999`  THEN 10
    WHEN `S$100,000 or more`     THEN 15


§§ `cl.2.7-2.9 -- the Savings Bonus caps, as the text states them`

-- The Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per calendar month, by card and band. (Total across
-- categories; Solitaire's per-category figure is half.)
GIVEN c IS A Card
      band IS A `Savings band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` c `in the band` band MEANS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `Under S$10,000`        THEN 0
    WHEN `S$10,000 to S$49,999`  THEN `the first-band cap for` c
    WHEN `S$50,000 to S$99,999`  THEN 2 TIMES (`the first-band cap for` c)
    WHEN `S$100,000 or more`     THEN 3 TIMES (`the first-band cap for` c)

-- cl.2.7(a): 1,000; cl.2.8(a): 1,500; cl.2.9(a): 2,000.
GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the first-band cap for` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `UOB Lady's Classic`            THEN 1000
    WHEN `UOB Lady's Platinum`           THEN 1000
    WHEN `UOB Lady's World Mastercard`   THEN 1000
    WHEN `UOB Lady's Solitaire`          THEN 1500
    WHEN `UOB Lady's Solitaire Metal`    THEN 2000
    OTHERWISE                                 0


§§ `The uplift on one purchase`

-- The dollars of this purchase that still earn the Bonus: limited by the room
-- under the Bonus cap, at 9 UNI$ per S$5 (so room x 5 / 9 dollars).
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      room IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the dollars that still earn the Bonus` amount room MEANS
    min amount ((room TIMES 5) DIVIDED BY 9)

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      room IS A NUMBER
      perFive IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Savings UNI$ by blocks` amount room perFive MEANS
    (min (FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)) (FLOOR (room DIVIDED BY 9))) TIMES perFive

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      room IS A NUMBER
      perFive IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Savings UNI$ pro rata` amount room perFive MEANS
    FLOOR (((`the dollars that still earn the Bonus` amount room) DIVIDED BY 5) TIMES perFive)

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      room IS A NUMBER
      perFive IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF Condition
`Savings rounding and band conditions at` amount room perFive MEANS
    IF `Savings UNI$ by blocks` amount room perFive EQUALS `Savings UNI$ pro rata` amount room perFive
    THEN LIST `Lady's: the Savings band holds for the whole calendar month`
    ELSE LIST `Lady's: the Savings band holds for the whole calendar month`, `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      h IS A `Lady's holder`
      m IS A `Lady's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Lady's Savings uplift when the code is settled` c p h m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` (h's `Lady's Savings band`)) EQUALS 0
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `UNI$` `per` "Lady's Savings Rewards T&C cl.2.5 (MAB under S$10,000)"
        IF `the Lady's card excludes the purchase` p
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `UNI$` `per` "Lady's Savings Rewards T&C cl.2.4 (in addition to Base and Bonus UNI$)"
        OTHERWISE `Lady's Savings uplift in the elected category` c p h m (`the elected Lady's category that the purchase falls in among` p (h's `elected categories`))

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      h IS A `Lady's holder`
      m IS A `Lady's month`
      found IS A MAYBE `Solitaire category`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Lady's Savings uplift in the elected category` c p h m found MEANS
    CONSIDER found
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `UNI$` `per` "Lady's Savings Rewards T&C cl.2.2(c): no elected category covers this purchase"
    WHEN JUST cat THEN `Lady's Savings uplift at the room in` cat c p h m

GIVEN cat IS A `Solitaire category`
      c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      h IS A `Lady's holder`
      m IS A `Lady's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Lady's Savings uplift at the room in` cat c p h m MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `UNI$` `of` (`Savings UNI$ by blocks` (p's `amount in SGD`) (`the Lady's Bonus UNI$ room in` cat `on` c `for the holder` h `in the month` m) (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` (h's `Lady's Savings band`))) `to` (`Savings UNI$ pro rata` (p's `amount in SGD`) (`the Lady's Bonus UNI$ room in` cat `on` c `for the holder` h `in the month` m) (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` (h's `Lady's Savings band`))) `wanting` 0 `at` (JUST `miles per UNI$ for the Lady's cards`) `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` (`Lady's category` cat) `depending on` (`Savings rounding and band conditions at` (p's `amount in SGD`) (`the Lady's Bonus UNI$ room in` cat `on` c `for the holder` h `in the month` m) (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` (h's `Lady's Savings band`))) `per` "Lady's Savings Rewards T&C cl.2.3-2.9"

`a Lady's Savings code that is excluded` MEANS 4829

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      h IS A `Lady's holder`
      m IS A `Lady's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` c p h m MEANS
    IF `the code is unknown for` p
    THEN `bracketed from` (`Lady's Savings uplift when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Lady's Savings code that is excluded`) h m) `to` (`Lady's Savings uplift when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p (`a code in the first elected category of` (h's `elected categories`))) h m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant category code is not known`)
    ELSE `Lady's Savings uplift when the code is settled` c p h m

-- The all-in earn of a Lady's card for a cardholder with the savings account:
-- the Lady's Cards answer plus the uplift.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      h IS A `Lady's holder`
      m IS A `Lady's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` c p h m MEANS
    `the answers added` (`UOB Lady's card earns on` c p h m) (`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` c p h m)


§§ `Illustrations`

GIVEN band IS A `Savings band`
GIVETH A `Lady's holder`
`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` band MEANS
    `Lady's holder` WITH
        `elected categories`  IS LIST `Dining`, `Family`
        `Lady's Savings band` IS band

GIVEN band IS A `Savings band`
GIVETH A `Lady's holder`
`a Lady's Classic holder who elected Dining with the balance in` band MEANS
    `Lady's holder` WITH
        `elected categories`  IS LIST `Dining`
        `Lady's Savings band` IS band

`the Solitaire card` MEANS `UOB Lady's Solitaire`
`the Classic card` MEANS `UOB Lady's Classic`

-- cl.2.3: the uplift per S$5 by band.
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` `Under S$10,000` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` `S$10,000 to S$49,999` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` `S$50,000 to S$99,999` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ per S$5 for` `S$100,000 or more` EQUALS 15

-- cl.2.7-2.9: the caps as printed, nine figures.
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Classic` `in the band` `S$10,000 to S$49,999` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Classic` `in the band` `S$50,000 to S$99,999` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Classic` `in the band` `S$100,000 or more` EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$10,000 to S$49,999` EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$50,000 to S$99,999` EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$100,000 or more` EQUALS 4500
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire Metal` `in the band` `S$10,000 to S$49,999` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire Metal` `in the band` `S$50,000 to S$99,999` EQUALS 4000
#ASSERT `the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire Metal` `in the band` `S$100,000 or more` EQUALS 6000
-- ... and the sums the text prints: Solitaire 2,700 + 1,500 = 4,200; 2,700 + 3,000 = 5,700; 2,700 + 4,500 = 7,200.
#ASSERT 2700 PLUS (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) EQUALS 4200
#ASSERT 2700 PLUS (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$50,000 to S$99,999`) EQUALS 5700
#ASSERT 2700 PLUS (`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$100,000 or more`) EQUALS 7200
-- ... and the per-category figures 2,100 / 2,850 / 3,600 are 1,350 + half of each Savings cap.
#ASSERT 1350 PLUS ((`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 2100
#ASSERT 1350 PLUS ((`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$50,000 to S$99,999`) DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 2850
#ASSERT 1350 PLUS ((`the Lady's Savings Bonus UNI$ cap per month for` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `in the band` `S$100,000 or more`) DIVIDED BY 2) EQUALS 3600

-- The all-in earn: S$100 at a restaurant on a Solitaire card.
--   below S$10k:  Base 20 + Bonus 180 = 200 UNI$ = 400 miles = 4 mpd
--   S$10k-50k:    + 5X x 20 blocks = 100 -> 300 UNI$ = 600 miles = 6 mpd
--   S$50k-100k:   + 10X x 20 = 200 -> 400 UNI$ = 800 miles = 8 mpd
--   S$100k+:      + 15X x 20 = 300 -> 500 UNI$ = 1,000 miles = 10 mpd
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `Under S$10,000`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 300
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$50,000 to S$99,999`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 400
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$100,000 or more`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 500
#ASSERT fromMaybe 0 ((`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `miles certain`) EQUALS 600
#ASSERT fromMaybe 0 ((`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$100,000 or more`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `miles certain`) EQUALS 1000
-- Every uplift answer names the band condition.
#ASSERT elem `Lady's: the Savings band holds for the whole calendar month` ((`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `depends on`)

-- The uplift stops when the Bonus stops: with the Dining pot full (1,350), S$100 earns the base 20 only.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) (`a Lady's month with` 1350 `and` 0 `Bonus UNI$ so far`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... with 1,300 earned (50 UNI$ of Bonus room = S$27.78), 10 whole blocks remain... 50 / 9 = 5 blocks: Base 20 + Bonus 50 + uplift 5 x 5 = 25 -> 95.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) (`a Lady's month with` 1300 `and` 0 `Bonus UNI$ so far`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 95
-- Below S$10,000 the uplift answer is nothing earned (cl.2.5); the Base and Bonus continue.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` `the Solitaire card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `Under S$10,000`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s excluded
-- A purchase outside the elected categories earns no uplift.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` `the Solitaire card` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5462) (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$100,000 or more`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s excluded
-- A reversed charge or an excluded charge earns no uplift.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` `the Solitaire card` (`purchase later reversed` `the base purchase`) (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$100,000 or more`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s excluded

-- The Classic family: S$100 at a restaurant on a Classic card electing Dining, S$10k-50k band:
-- Base 20 + Bonus 180 + uplift 100 = 300.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's card with the Savings Account earns on` `the Classic card` `the base purchase` (`a Lady's Classic holder who elected Dining with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) (`Lady's month` WITH `Bonus UNI$ by elected category` IS LIST 0))'s `units certain` EQUALS 300

-- The code not known: floor 0 (it might be excluded or outside the elected categories), ceiling the full uplift.
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` `the Solitaire card` (`purchase with unknown code` `the base purchase`) (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`UOB Lady's Savings uplift earns on` `the Solitaire card` (`purchase with unknown code` `the base purchase`) (`a Lady's Solitaire holder who elected Dining and Family with the balance in` `S$10,000 to S$49,999`) `a fresh Lady's month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 100
